<title>USA: Consolidated Delivery buys Hurry Wagon.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Delivery buys Hurry Wagon.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Delivery and Logistics Inc said on Friday that it has acquired Hurry Wagon Inc, a Rochester, New York-based same-day courier company.</p>
<p>Terms were not made public.</p>
<p>Hurry Wagon, with revenues of about $3 million, will be absorbed into the northeast region, Consolidated said.</p>
<p>The transaction increases Consolidated's penetration of the upstate New York area, along with the opportunity to reduce overhead, the company said.</p>
</text>
